data: {"type":"response.function_call_arguments.done","sequence_number":421,"item_id":"fc_09b52967a043482d016adf3c73b664819193b976fa3cb16153","output_index":0,"arguments":"{\"pointer\":\"/checks/complete_target_and_representations\",\"coverage\":\"assessed\",\"judgment\":{\"verdict\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"The full inspected root quantifies over all source parameters with exactly H001–H006 and concludes nonzero reduction plus the zero/whole alternative for every K-linear subspace invariant under the induced x,y,h. Checked the author's equivalences independently against source-context.json and actual LR definitions (Proof.lean 5–102), not just the signature comparison. A bracket triple presents the source sl2 action; H004/H005 retain dimension, irreducibility and highest weight. H006 permits every admissible lattice, with no chosen minimal lattice or string-basis premise. DP stability encodes the generated integer algebra. IntegralOps fields only describe actual restrictions and inherited brackets; T007 (414–450) constructs these, so there is no hidden stronger premise. Scalar-first VK is the canonical flipped source tensor; no second tensor-order representation is used in code. The actual second representations used for localization and residue reduction have checked maps: T006 identifies R tensor M with the span by its pure-tensor formula; T017 constructs A with A(c tensor m)=c tensor inc(m); T018 constructs C to the residue tensor, including compatible scalar actions; T019 transports the basis; T020 (1214–1235) proves A intertwines the induced operators by tensor induction and agreement on M. The endpoint consequently concerns the actual tensor-induced action, not merely an isomorphic abstract module with unspecified operators. Generator invariance captures L(K) by linear span and remains valid for nonfaithful actions, lam=0 and characteristic 2. No assumption of algebraic closure, odd p, or distinct weights after reduction occurs.\",\"locations\":[\"/scope\",\"/endpoints\",\"/mechanical_summary\",\"/scope/full_target\",\"/scope/parameters\",\"/scope/hypotheses\",\"/endpoints/P/source\",\"/endpoints/P/actual\",\"/endpoints/P/correspondence\",\"/documents/0\",\"/documents/2\"]}}"}

